"partOfTerm":"B","meetings":[{"type":"Online","days":[],"start":null,"end":null,"location":"","instructors":["Branham, B","McCoy, J"]}],"restrictions":[],"note":"Topic: Sport and Lawn Turf Management Description: Turfgrasses comprise over 40 million acres of residential lawns, parks, golf courses, and athletic fields, and are a major US crop with acreage similar to wheat. Lawns provide numerous ecosystem services including carbon sequestration, evaporative cooling, and water filtration. However, turfgrasses are criticized for excessive water, fertilizer, and pesticide use. This course examines the environmental concerns and benefits of turfgrasses with an emphasis on sports turf design, construction, and maintenance."}]},{"id":"HORT 205","title":"Local Food Systems","creditHours":"3 hours.","sections":[{"crn":"55412","code":"A","type":"Laboratory-Discussion","partOfTerm":"1","meetings":[{"type":"Laboratory-Discussion","days":["M"],"start":600,"end":650,"location":"1103 Plant Sciences Laboratory","instructors":["McCoy, J","Turino, M"]},{"type":"Lecture","days":["W"],"start":600,"end":710,"location":"1103 Plant Sciences Laboratory","instructors":["McCoy, J","Turino, M"]}],"restrictions":[],"note":""}]},{"id":"HORT 341","title":"Greenhouse Mgmt and Production","creditHours":"4 hours.","sections":[{"crn":"62293","code":"A","type":"Laboratory","partOfTerm":"1","meetings":[{"type":"Laboratory","days":["F"],"start":540,"end":710,"location":"1125 Plant Sciences Laboratory","instructors":["Sacks, E"]},{"type":"Online Lecture","days":["M","W"],"start":840,"end":890,"location":"","instructors":["Sacks, E"]}],"restrictions":[],"note":""}]},{"id":"HORT 361","title":"Small Fruit Production","creditHours":"2 hours.","sections":[{"crn":"63547","code":"B","type":"Lecture-Discussion","partOfTerm":"B","meetings":[{"type":"Lecture-Discussion","days":["M","W"],"start":720,"end":830,"location":"1303 Plant Sciences Laboratory","instructors":["Taylor, A"]}],"restrictions":[],"note":""},{"c